  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LPB Expanding Access to Finance for Women-Owned Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Asian Development Bank (ADB) is providing financing to Lien Viet Post Joint Stock Commercial Bank (LPB), one of the private joint stock banks in Viet Nam, which will help increase LPB&apos;s capacity to finance underserved small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs). The transaction will specifically target small and medium-sized enterprises owned by women (WSMEs), which are particularly underserved.</narrative>
  </description>
